From: mscharged-port
Subject: Tweak: training keeps Strikers 101's music up to the match
Upstream-base: 8b9d92dd88b4c727cc6359ee4cd5ba128cced7b8

Strikers 101's FREE PLAY (tweak patch 0092) went into Domination's captains
with the main menu's music (stream 1), and the captains, sidekicks and
Choose Sides would start Domination's (stream 2, the same music). In
training's flow none of them changes it now: Strikers 101's music goes on
up to the match. The stadiums stop the music for their previews' sound, and
their Back, which goes to Choose Sides, starts Strikers 101's again instead
of Domination's.

diff --git a/src/Game/SH/SHChallengeSelect.cpp b/src/Game/SH/SHChallengeSelect.cpp
index 1756144..8da17a9 100644
--- a/src/Game/SH/SHChallengeSelect.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/SH/SHChallengeSelect.cpp
@@ -544,7 +544,7 @@ void ChallengeSelectScene::StartFreePlay()
 {
     // As the main menu's Domination (SHMainMenu::ApplyItem), then marked as
     // training's match (SetMode clears the mark): the list stays where it was
-    // for the way back.
+    // for the way back. Strikers 101's music goes on up to the match.
     GameInfoManager* gameInfo = GameInfoManager::Instance();
     gameInfo->SetMode(GameInfoManager::GM_FRIENDLY, 0);
     g_bTrainingMatch = true;
@@ -553,7 +553,6 @@ void ChallengeSelectScene::StartFreePlay()
     gameInfo->SetTeam(1, 0);
     gameInfo->ResetPlayingSides();
     g_pStrikerChallenge->mChallengeOffset = mChallengeOffset;
-    FEMusic::StartStreamIfDifferent(1);
     GameSceneManager::Instance()->Push(SCENE_CHOOSE_CAPTAINS_DOMINATION, SCREEN_FORWARD, true);
 }
 #endif
diff --git a/src/Game/SH/SHChooseCaptains.cpp b/src/Game/SH/SHChooseCaptains.cpp
index e6d0bca..7571aa8 100644
--- a/src/Game/SH/SHChooseCaptains.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/SH/SHChooseCaptains.cpp
@@ -257,6 +257,11 @@ void ChooseCaptainsSceneV2::SceneCreated()
         mCaptainComponents[1].ShowSlideIn();
         mSelectButtonInstances[1]->SetVisible(false);
         UpdateSelectText(1);
+#if defined(MSCHARGED_TWEAKS)
+        // Port tweak "Training": Strikers 101's FREE PLAY keeps its music
+        // here, as Choose Sides and the stadiums do.
+        if (!g_bTrainingMatch)
+#endif
         FEMusic::StartStreamIfDifferent(2);
     }
 
